## Roadmap

- [ ] **PatchCore** — full implementation of PatchCore anomaly detection on DINOv2 features fitted from golden video frames.
- [ ] **FLIP** — NVIDIA FLIP perceptual metric integration (currently falls back to SSIM).
- [ ] **PresentMon parsing** — real PresentMon CSV ingestion for frame-time and GPU telemetry correlation.
- [ ] **RAFT optical flow** — replace Farneback with RAFT for higher-quality flow estimation.
- [ ] **Regression-vs-golden CI mode** — GitHub Actions / CI integration for automated pass/fail gating against a golden build.
